## 常用命令

```bash
# 启动开发服务器
uvicorn app.main:app --reload

# 代码检查
ruff check app/
ruff format app/

# 测试
pytest

# 数据库迁移
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "xxx"
alembic upgrade head
```

